  "description": "Jersey Western is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic American varsity lettering, Western typography, and vintage sports aesthetics. Its strong slab-serif structure and distinctive cuts create an authentic collegiate and cowboy-inspired look. Perfect for sports branding, team jerseys, Western designs, apparel, logos, posters, badges, labels, merchandise, and other bold creative projects.\nFeatures:\n– Bold Western-style display lettering\n– Classic varsity and collegiate feel\n– Strong and highly readable characters\n– Great for sports and Western-themed designs\n– Suitable for print and digital projects\n– Perfect for branding, apparel, and merchandise\nPerfect For:\nT-shirt designs, jersey designs, sports branding, baseball, football, basketball, Western logos, cowboy graphics, posters, badges, stickers, labels, packaging, invitations, social media graphics, Cricut projects, and sublimation.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Jersey Western is a bold and rugged display font inspired by classic American varsity lettering, Western typography, and vintage sports aesthetics. Its strong slab-serif structure and distinctive cuts create an authentic collegiate and cowboy-inspired look. Perfect for sports branding, team jerseys, Western designs, apparel, logos, posters, badges, labels, merchandise, and other bold creative projects.</p>\n<p>Features:</p>\n<p>– Bold Western-style display lettering<br>\n– Classic varsity and collegiate feel<br>\n– Strong and highly readable characters<br>\n– Great for sports and Western-themed designs<br>\n– Suitable for print and digital projects<br>\n– Perfect for branding, apparel, and merchandise</p>\n<p>Perfect For:<br>\nT-shirt designs, jersey designs, sports branding, baseball, football, basketball, Western logos, cowboy graphics, posters, badges, stickers, labels, packaging, invitations, social media graphics, Cricut projects, and sublimation.</p>",
